ast territory stretching from Manchuria to the borders of India. This fast expansion of Japan was driven by a desire for resources and a belief in their divine right to rule Asia. From the Aleutian Islands in the north to the Solomon Islands in the south, the Japanese empire grew into a dominating empire across the Pacific. However, this overextension of their forces and the fierce resistance of Allied powers proved unsustainable and led to their eventual downfall.","LocalizedString":"The Japanese military's \"Great Expanse\" during WWII was a display of ambition and ruthlessness. Within a few short months their forces swept across the Pacific and conquered a vast territory stretching from Manchuria to the borders of India. This fast expansion of Japan was driven by a desire for resources and a belief in their divine right to rule Asia. From the Aleutian Islands in the north to the Solomon Islands in the south, the Japanese empire grew into a dominating empire across the Pacific. However, this overextension of their forces and the fierce resistance of Allied powers proved unsustainable and led to their eventual downfall."},"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Unique","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::CurrentExpansion","soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'War_UI_Drum_Movement_Taiko_Hits_1'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/War_UI/Waves/Drum_Movements/War_UI_Drum_Movement_Taiko_Hits_1.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Japan/CandidateArtwork/Summer_24/t_the_great_expanse_vs_2.t_the_great_expanse_vs_2","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Japanese WWII Poster","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/THE_GREAT_EXPANSE.THE_GREAT_EXPANSE","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":353.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_event_great_expanse_photo","SourceString":"Japanese marines during the Battle of Shanghai, 1937.","LocalizedString":"Japanese marines during the Battle of Shanghai, 1937."},"isDraw":true,"